     "langs": [
      "en"
     ],
     "text": "This is fascinating. On the work we've done on the impacts of voice transcription, lots of ppl note it can have a chilling effect on workplace relationships (no one wants their start-of-meeting anecdotes logged) and also what they are willing to say \"on the record\", plus lots of implications for HR"
    },
