       "text": "It's worth paying attention not just to what AI can & can't do, but also how companies change the nature of human work in order to make AI more effective. At Anthropic, everyone's work & meetings have to be machine-readable, so that AI agents can see what's happening. www.ft.com/content/9df5..."
